🇺🇸🇮🇷 US Retroactively Justifying War on Iran Based on Growing US Deaths

▪️Just like the US invasion and occupation of Iraq (which continues to this day), the US lied to start a war with Iran and is now using the growing number of dead US service members as justification for continuing the war;

▪️The growing number of dead US service members in Iraq became in and of itself a pretext to continue the war/occupation - and the retroactive justification was used by all US presidential administrations once in office no matter what they promised during campaigns;

▪️As warned, the US has no intention of ending its war with Iran nor does it seek to stop regional destruction - it all serves the wider objective of burning the multipolar world down in place of being able to match or contain it;
